@clock @navigation @wip Scenario: Leaving and returning preserves display type and format Given the system time is 16:00:05 ... passed in 0.002s And the active app is "Clock" ... passed in 0.001s And the clock format is 12h ... passed in 0.001s And the display type is Analogue ... passed in 0.001s When I switch to the "Energy" app ... failed in 0.001s And 5 seconds elapse ... skipped in 0.000s And I switch back to the "Clock" app ... skipped in 0.000s Then the clock shows time "04:00:10" ... skipped in 0.000s And the display type is Analogue ... skipped in 0.000s
